/E (The collected data was analyzed using both qualitative and quantitative approaches. Qualitative analysis included interpreting observations and interview responses to understand user behavior and experiences. Quantitative analysis involved identifying trends and patterns from survey data. Frameworks such as AEIOU \(Activities, Environment, Interaction, Objects, Users\) and empathy mapping were used to structure insights. Additionally, protocol analysis \(think-aloud method\) was applied to track user thought processes during decision-making.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
