/P 163 0 R
/E (Most customers rely on a mix of visual cues and familiarity while ordering. While some users explore the menu, a large portion prefers sticking to known items, especially when the menu is complex. Increased options lead to decision fatigue, causing delays or random selection.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
