407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (The collected data was analyzed using a combination of qualitative and quantitative research approaches. Qualitative analysis involved interpreting observational data and interview responses to understand user behavior, preferences, and pain points. Quantitative analysis focused on identifying patterns, trends, and frequency-based insights from survey responses. Analytical frameworks such as AEIOU \(Activities, Environment, Interaction, Objects, Users\) and empathy mapping were applied to structure user insights. In addition, protocol analysis \(think-aloud method\) was used to capture real-time cognitive processes and decision-making behavior during menu interaction.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
