/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 166 0 R
/E (The findings indicate that menu design has a direct and measurable impact on customer ordering behavior and decision efficiency. Visual elements such as images, highlighted sections, and strategic item placement significantly increased attention and item selection. Menus with clear structure and hierarchy improved navigation, comprehension, and speed of decision-making, while cluttered and dense layouts led to confusion, hesitation, and reliance on familiar choices. Overall, the results demonstrate that effective menu design enhances both user experience and business performance outcomes.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
